{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：16:10 2026-10-26 HKT<br/>發佈時間：16:10 2026-10-26 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：16:10 2026-10-26 HKT</p><img alt=\"布文（左一）今日拴住拐仗以行動支持由「New Zealand Bloodstock」主辦的高爾夫球賽。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/59bbe8fbf44688256f6ed1f53adcf944/2026-10/3_3_15.jpg\"/><p>久違了的布文今日拴住拐仗，遠赴澳門出席由「New Zealand Bloodstock」主辦的高爾夫球賽，雖然未可落場揮桿，亦已行動表示支持。布文因右側髖關節嚴重勞損，早前接受手術根治，他指康復需時，預期要三個月至半年後，才可恢復策馬。這位現齡47歲的好手於今季9月6日的沙田開鑼賽事策廖廄「喜悅歡欣」火速開齋，惟之後因要療傷再無披甲。</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9c60aa6ab1cd4d755315f091d68205be/2026-10/1_10_37.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/160f037afd829ac1f98faa68fabc7ee7/2026-10/2_10_16.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/af7c63e075db3ba97f025999581f8853/2026-10/4_10_14.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c39467a503b175ea8cd651693f3320ea/2026-10/5_9_12.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T08:21:31.767745+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":251,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T08:10:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T11:18:32.593172+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T08:18:26.427756+00:00","content_hash":"42edc34d9e2e288687b4818b1a47f6cd16b90e785cd95097a201258d4e5dc280","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}